10615: 31:20
10616:        W_MASK WO  Window mask--This field specifies the size of the PCI
10617:        <31:20>    target window. It can also mask the address bits that
10618:                   are not used when translating the PCI address to the
10619: 19:0 RES    X     CPU address to determine whether an address matches
10620:                   the PCI target window address range.
10621: 
10622:                   Reserved.
10623: 
10624: 6.4.11 Translated Base Registers
10625: 
10626:             There is one translated base (IOC_T_BASE) register for each PCI target
10627:             window.
10628: 
10629:             When direct-mapped address translation is used, the translated address is
10630:             generated by concatenating bits from an IOC_T_BASE register with bits from
10631:             the incoming PCI address. The IOC_W_MASK register determines which
10632:             IOC_T_BASE register bits and PCI address bits are concatenated to form the
10633:             translated address. The translated address is the starting address in system
10634:             memory for the PCI transaction.
10635: 
10636:             When scatter-gather mapped address translation is used, the translated
10637:             address is generated by table lookup. The table (scatter-gather map) is stored
10638:             in system memory. The IOC_T_BASE register specifies the starting address
10639:             of the scatter-gather map, and the incoming PCI address bits are used as an
10640:             offset from that address. (See Sections 6.3.2.1 and 6.3.2.2 for more information
10641:             about using these registers.)
10642: 
10643:             Software should ensure that the PCI is idle before updating these registers.
10644: 
10645:             The IOC_T_BASE0 register is accessed at address 18000018016 and the
10646:             IOC_T_BASE1 register is accessed at address 1800001A0. All bits of these
10647:             registers are UNDEFINED after reset.
10648: 
10649:                                                       I/O Controller 6-47
