1595:             An onchip performance recording mechanism counts various hardware events
1596:             and causes an interrupt upon counter overflow. Interrupts are triggered six
1597:             cycles after the event, and therefore, the exception program counter (PC) might
1598:             not reflect the exact instruction causing counter overflow.
